    <url>/2026/06/06/Tricks/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>对于任意非负整数$A$和$B$，有</p>
<p>$<br>\mathrm{popcount}(A \oplus B) \equiv \mathrm{popcount}(A) + \mathrm{popcount}(B) \quad (\mathrm{mod} 2)<br>$</p>
<span id="more"></span> ]]></content>
