  <entry>
    <title>Codeforces 2157 D Billion Players Game</title>
    <url>/2025/12/07/cf-2157d/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>给定整数区间$[l, r]$和整数数组$a$</p>
<p>对于每个数，需要从下面三种操作中选择一种：</p>
<ul>
<li>放弃该数，贡献为0</li>
<li>选择$p \le a_i$. 若最终该条件成立，贡献为$|p - a_i|$, 否则为$-|p - a_i|$.</li>
<li>选择$p \ge a_i$. 若最终该条件成立，贡献为$|p - a_i|$, 否则为$-|p - a_i|$.</li>
</ul>
<p>对手会选择一个$p \in [l, r]$使你的收益最小化。</p>
<p>对于所有的操作选择方案，最大化收益。</p>
<p>$1 \le l \le r \le 10^9,   1 \le |a| \le 2 \cdot 10^5,  1 \le a_i \le 10^9$.</p>
<span id="more"></span>
<p>关键在于对题目这个操作的转化，发现最终的贡献是一个关于p的一次函数，所以一定是单调的，极值一定在两个断点处。</p>
<p>$\mathrm{ans} = \sum{p - a_i} = |a|p - \sum{a_i}$, 其中$|a|$和$\sum{a_i}$是固定的常数，贡献只与$p$有关。</p>
<p>所以按顺序枚举所有情况，从$p \le a_i$到放弃再到$p \ge a_i$，线性求一下贡献即可。</p>
<p>时间复杂度$O(n)$.</p>
<figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> ll = <span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">solve</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> n;</span><br><span class="line">    ll l, r;</span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; l &gt;&gt; r;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function">vector&lt;ll&gt; <span class="title">a</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cin &gt;&gt; a[i];</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">sort</span>(a.<span class="built_in">begin</span>() + <span class="number">1</span>, a.<span class="built_in">end</span>());</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll ansl = <span class="number">0</span>, ansr = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    vector&lt;ll&gt; b;</span><br><span class="line">    b.<span class="built_in">reserve</span>(n + <span class="number">1</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (a[i] &lt; l) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            ansl += l - a[i];</span><br><span class="line">            ansr += r - a[i];</span><br><span class="line">        &#125; <span class="keyword">else</span> <span class="keyword">if</span> (a[i] &gt; r) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            ansl += a[i] - l;</span><br><span class="line">            ansr += a[i] - r;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125; <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            ansl += a[i] - l;</span><br><span class="line">            ansr += a[i] - r;</span><br><span class="line">            b.<span class="built_in">push_back</span>(a[i]);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll ans = <span class="built_in">min</span>(ansl, ansr);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">0</span>; i &lt; b.<span class="built_in">size</span>(); ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        ansl -= b[i] - l;</span><br><span class="line">        ansr += r - b[i];</span><br><span class="line">        ans = <span class="built_in">max</span>(ans, <span class="built_in">min</span>(ansl, ansr));</span><br><span class="line">        ansl -= b[i] - l;</span><br><span class="line">        ansr += r - b[i];</span><br><span class="line">        ans = <span class="built_in">max</span>(ans, <span class="built_in">min</span>(ansl, ansr));</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    cout &lt;&lt; ans &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    ios::<span class="built_in">sync_with_stdio</span>(<span class="literal">false</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    cin.<span class="built_in">tie</span>(<span class="literal">nullptr</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> _;</span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; _;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (_--) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">solve</span>();</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>启示：要学会转化，将复杂的条件简单化（例如本题虽然贡献有加或者减，但直接就是$p - a_i$, 这样完美概括了加或者减的情况，就可以进一步观察性质）。</p>
]]></content>
      <categories>
        <category>简易题解</category>
      </categories>
      <tags>
        <tag>思维</tag>
      </tags>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>Codeforces 2167 F Tree, TREE!!!</title>
    <url>/2025/12/06/cf-2167f/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>给一棵n个点的树，再给一个限制k.</p>
<p>定义$S_r$表示以r为根时，从其子树中选择k个点，它们的LCA构成的非重集合。</p>
<p>求$\sum_{r=1}^{n}{|S_r|}$</p>
<p>$2 \le k \le n \le 2 \cdot 10^5$.</p>
<span id="more"></span>
<p>显然不可能真的去求所有的组合，所以需要先把$|S_r|$是什么搞明白。</p>
<p>很自然的考虑到和子树大小有关。</p>
<p>假设当前的根为$r$, 点为$u$, 如果$u$的子树大小$\mathrm{sz}[u] \ge k$, 那么一定可以从中选出k个，使LCA为$u$.</p>
<p>所以也就是求$\sum_{r=1}^{n}{\sum_{i=1}^{n}{|\mathrm{sz_r[i]} \ge k|}} = \sum_{i=1}^{n}{\sum_{r=1}^{n}{|\mathrm{sz_r[i]} \ge k|}}$.</p>
<p>考虑先以1为根求出sz, 然后通过换根的思想求出答案。</p>
<p>假设当前的点为$u$, 全局考虑$u$对答案的贡献，也就是算有几个点作根时，满足$\mathrm{sz}[u] \ge k$. </p>
<p>第一，$u$自己作根时，$\mathrm{sz}_u[u] = n \ge k$, 显然会有贡献。</p>
<p>第二，如果$\mathrm{sz}_1[u] \ge k$, 那么剩下$n - \mathrm{sz}_1[u]$个点作根，$u$会有贡献。</p>
<p>第三，考虑$u$的相邻点$v_j$, 如果$n - \mathrm{sz}_1[v_j] \ge k$, 那么$v_j$的子树做根，$u$会有贡献。</p>
<p>这样遍历一遍就能求出答案。</p>
<p>时间复杂度$O(n)$.</p>
<figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> ll = <span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">solve</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> n, k;</span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; n &gt;&gt; k;</span><br><span class="line">    vector&lt;vector&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt; &gt; <span class="built_in">adj</span>(n + <span class="number">1</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt; n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">int</span> u, v;</span><br><span class="line">        cin &gt;&gt; u &gt;&gt; v;</span><br><span class="line">        adj[u].<span class="built_in">push_back</span>(v);</span><br><span class="line">        adj[v].<span class="built_in">push_back</span>(u);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function">vector&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt; <span class="title">sz</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">auto</span> dfs = [&amp;](<span class="keyword">auto</span>&amp;&amp; self, <span class="type">int</span> u, <span class="type">int</span> pa) -&gt; <span class="type">void</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        sz[u] = <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="keyword">auto</span> v : adj[u]) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span> (v == pa)</span><br><span class="line">                <span class="keyword">continue</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">self</span>(self, v, u);</span><br><span class="line">            sz[u] += sz[v];</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">dfs</span>(dfs, <span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">0</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    </span><br><span class="line">    ll ans = n;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">auto</span> dfs1 = [&amp;](<span class="keyword">auto</span>&amp;&amp; self, <span class="type">int</span> u, <span class="type">int</span> pa) -&gt; <span class="type">void</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (sz[u] &gt;= k) </span><br><span class="line">            ans += n - sz[u];</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="keyword">auto</span> v : adj[u]) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span> (v == pa)</span><br><span class="line">                <span class="keyword">continue</span>;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span> (n - sz[v] &gt;= k)</span><br><span class="line">                ans += sz[v];</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">self</span>(self, v, u);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">dfs1</span>(dfs1, <span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">0</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    cout &lt;&lt; ans &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    ios::<span class="built_in">sync_with_stdio</span>(<span class="literal">false</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    cin.<span class="built_in">tie</span>(<span class="literal">nullptr</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> _;</span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; _;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (_--) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">solve</span>();</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>启示：由繁化简，分类讨论求贡献。</p>
]]></content>
