    <title>Codeforces 2167 G Mukhammadali and the Smooth Array</title>
    <url>/2025/12/06/cf-2167g/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>有n个正整数a，可以选择其中的一些数把他们修改为任意整数。修改每个数的代价c不同。</p>
<p>问让这些数不下降的最小修改代价。</p>
<p>$1 \le n \le 8000,  1 \le a_i,c_i \le 10^9$.</p>
<span id="more"></span>
<p>做法为正难则反：正着求最小修改代价有点难，反过来求最大不修改代价比较好求，因为不修改就是让这些数保持不下降，是一个经典的DP入门场景。最终答案就是总的修改代价减去最大不修改代价。</p>
<p>和经典的最长不下降子序列很像，所以就省略具体的DP设计了。<br>$O(n^2)$做一下就好。</p>
<figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> ll = <span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title">solve</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> n;</span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; n;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function">vector&lt;ll&gt; <span class="title">a</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>)</span>, <span class="title">c</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function">vector&lt;ll&gt; <span class="title">dp</span><span class="params">(n + <span class="number">1</span>)</span></span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cin &gt;&gt; a[i];</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    ll s = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cin &gt;&gt; c[i];</span><br><span class="line">        dp[i] = c[i];</span><br><span class="line">        s += c[i];</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    ll maxx = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; ++i) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> j = <span class="number">1</span>; j &lt; i; ++j) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span> (a[j] &lt;= a[i]) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                dp[i] = <span class="built_in">max</span>(dp[i], dp[j] + c[i]);</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        maxx = <span class="built_in">max</span>(maxx, dp[i]);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    cout &lt;&lt; s - maxx &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span> </span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    ios::<span class="built_in">sync_with_stdio</span>(<span class="literal">false</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    cin.<span class="built_in">tie</span>(<span class="literal">nullptr</span>);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> _;</span><br><span class="line">    cin &gt;&gt; _;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (_--) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">solve</span>();</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<p>启示：先考虑贪心，发现无法贪心则考虑DP，正着无法DP就反着考虑。</p>
]]></content>
      <categories>
        <category>题解</category>
      </categories>
      <tags>
        <tag>DP</tag>
      </tags>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <title>常见函数有单调性场景</title>
    <url>/2026/06/04/%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E5%8D%95%E8%B0%83%E6%80%A7%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<p>常见的单峰信号有：</p>
<ol>
<li>边际收益递减<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">多选一个东西的好处越来越小</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>资源互斥<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">选择 A 类越多，B 类空间越少</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
</ol>
<span id="more"></span> 
<ol>
<li>前缀/后缀分界点<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">前 k 个做一类，后面做另一类</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>答案由两个单调取min/max<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">f(k) = min(递增函数, 递减函数)</span><br><span class="line">f(k) = max(递减函数, 递增函数)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
<li>越早越好/越晚越好的交换论证<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">如果能证明固定数量下，某种操作应该尽量靠前或尽量靠后，那通常说明原问题可以压成一个分界点。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
</ol>
<p>另外一种证明方式：<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">定义 f(k)。</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">只比较 f(k) 和 f(k+1)。</span><br><span class="line">从 k 到 k+1，只改变了第 k+1 个关键元素的状态。</span><br><span class="line">分析这个改变带来的收益和损失。</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">如果在 k+1 到 k+2 时仍然能变好，</span><br><span class="line">说明在 k 到 k+1 时也一定能变好。</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">因此：</span><br><span class="line">f(k+1) &lt; f(k+2) =&gt; f(k) &lt; f(k+1)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">所以一旦 f(k) &gt;= f(k+1)，后面就不会再上升。</span><br><span class="line">于是可以二分第一个 f(k) &gt;= f(k+1)。</span><br><span class="line">或者直接上三分。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>
]]></content>
